cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Redundancy Explorer to conduct research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Redundancy Explorer: Interactive Browser Application for Design Space Exploration Guided by Redundancy Matrices"
abstract: >-
  Interactive browser application for design space exploration guided by
  redundancy matrices, running entirely client-side with real-time redundancy
  visualization, topology editing, and gradient- and policy-guided
  redundancy homogenization.
